  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uniS9UM.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"276\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組將為你的遊戲增添各種新的裝飾性光源，從童話燈到小夜燈應有盡有！<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a_4T-7BOqCY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"325\" height=\"325\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術設計<br>samgj15 - 程式碼<br>flechazo098 - 程式碼<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 一款在 Minecraft 中加入驚奇生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 一款加入多種友善動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong>&nbsp;- 在你的世界中加入兩種友善的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a></strong> - 一款加入 9 種新傀儡類型的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 在遊戲中加入 60 種新近戰武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 一款全面翻新原版苦力怕的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 一款全面翻新原版終界使者的模組！<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></a>&nbsp;- 加入充滿名為「蛙村民」的小村民的沼澤村落！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jjiWlso.png\" width=\"879\" height=\"273\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hu0Djdp.png\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudnord.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLUVuvA.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"275\"></a></p>",
